972
00:44:14.180 --> 00:44:14.800
They're already.

973
00:44:14.800 --> 00:44:18.900
It's like that SNL sketch at Christmas.

974
00:44:19.120 --> 00:44:21.720
Everyone's saying, I got a piano.

975
00:44:21.980 --> 00:44:23.800
And the mom goes, and I got a robe.

976
00:44:23.960 --> 00:44:25.220
And that's all she got.

977
00:44:25.240 --> 00:44:26.680
And it's like over and over.

978
00:44:26.920 --> 00:44:28.060
But then I got a car.

979
00:44:28.220 --> 00:44:29.320
I got a robe.

980
00:44:29.700 --> 00:44:32.340
Also, at the end, they're like, wait a second.

