1223
00:55:52.620 --> 00:55:55.820
No one's going to want you later if you don't do this now.

1224
00:55:55.960 --> 00:55:56.120
Right.

1225
00:55:56.260 --> 00:56:01.440
Or you won't work later if you're not working now or any of it, you know.

1226
00:56:01.680 --> 00:56:03.200
And so you're like, oh, my God.

1227
00:56:03.320 --> 00:56:03.440
Yeah.

1228
00:56:03.580 --> 00:56:04.020
Oh, yeah.

1229
00:56:04.080 --> 00:56:05.460
I don't I don't want this to go away.

1230
00:56:06.060 --> 00:56:11.020
So it's very it can be kind of confusing what to do with that.

1231
00:56:11.560 --> 00:56:15.180
And then, of course, I had spent 10 years not working at all.

1232
00:56:15.540 --> 00:56:19.080
So you're like, yeah, yeah, I don't want I mean, I don't want to go back to that, I guess.

1233
00:56:19.220 --> 00:56:19.820
So I don't know.

1234
00:56:20.180 --> 00:56:20.360
Yeah.

1235
00:56:20.840 --> 00:56:25.360
I think for me, I would look back and just tell myself I'm going to be just fine.

1236
00:56:25.600 --> 00:56:38.900
I think I was just worried that I wasn't going to be everything I was thought I should be and that I don't need to be anything other than just OK with myself.

1237
00:56:39.320 --> 00:56:40.180
That's what I think.

1238
00:56:40.180 --> 00:56:53.060
It's interesting how similar there's sort of like like success on somebody else's terms is not success and success on your own terms doesn't have to look like somebody else's or like the sort of consensus aspiration.

1239
00:56:53.420 --> 00:56:53.500
Right.

1240
00:56:53.600 --> 00:56:57.180
It's like you and to be like, I'm basically I'm enough.

1241
00:56:57.400 --> 00:56:58.180
Who I am is enough.

1242
00:56:58.320 --> 00:56:59.340
What I want is enough.

1243
00:56:59.440 --> 00:56:59.620
Yeah.

1244
00:57:00.020 --> 00:57:06.060
I think then that was something in that blog post that made an impression on me when I read it, too, which is I think I don't remember the exact phrasing.

1245
00:57:06.180 --> 00:57:07.740
It was basically like don't postpone joy.

1246
00:57:07.740 --> 00:57:13.220
Don't make a certain kind of professional success a prerequisite for participating in your own life.

1247
00:57:13.380 --> 00:57:14.460
That's my recollection.

1248
00:57:14.780 --> 00:57:14.980
Yeah.

1249
00:57:15.080 --> 00:57:18.380
Well, that was a thing when you're a struggling actor, especially you're like, well,

1250
00:57:18.420 --> 00:57:22.920
